================================================================================================
🚀 Compile-me: exists so people can easily clone and experiment with Nuitka & uv
================================================================================================

[BADGE] Version: 1.0.0  | [BADGE] License: Informational  | [BADGE] Python: 3.8+ 


This repository is designed for Python developers looking to take their scripts or microservices to production with maximum speed and portability. The examples showcased in the project demonstrate best practices for:



Ultra-Fast Dependency Management: Using uv (Astral's package manager) to install, resolve, and manage dependencies almost instantly.


Simple and Secure Distribution: Compiling the Python application and all its dependencies into a single executable binary (standalone) using Nuitka. This eliminates the need for the end-user to install Python or configure environments, allowing for clean and direct deployment.
---

